# =========================================================
#  .gitignore — IHPC Hybrid Infrastructure Project
#  Rule: only project content is tracked. Tooling state,
#  OS clutter, secrets, and generated files stay out.
# =========================================================

# --- Obsidian vault config (machine-specific tooling, not project content) ---
# The Kanban board lives at docs/kanban-board.md and is tracked; the vault is not.
.obsidian/
Obsidian/
.trash/
# Obsidian creates an empty note at vault root when a [[wikilink]] on the board is clicked.
# Card titles are not documents; deliverables live under docs/.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md

# --- Secrets & credentials (NEVER commit these) ---
# .gitignore only stops FUTURE tracking — never paste a live secret into a tracked file.
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets/
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.crt
*.cer
*.ppk
credentials
credentials.*
*_rsa
*_rsa.pub
id_rsa*
.ssh/
appsettings.*.json
*.publishsettings

# --- Cloud / API config (Azure, cloud CLIs) ---
.azure/
*.azureauth
*.tfvars
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/

# --- OS clutter ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*~

# --- Editor / IDE state ---
.vs/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# --- Logs & temp files ---
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp

# --- Archives & large binaries (usually don't belong in a docs repo) ---
*.zip
*.7z
*.iso
*.vhd
*.vhdx